Thu Sep 24 09:43:52 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 0.9.67:
  * Fix the PYTHONHASHSEED determinism pin to re-exec via
    python -m graphify (repairs Windows console-script
    re-launch)
  * Extract PHP closures with semantic route names; absolute
    Python imports resolve to local nodes

-------------------------------------------------------------------
Wed Sep 23 14:46:43 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- New package graphifyy 0.9.66, successor of the
  python-graphifyy multibuild package (now Obsoleted): single
  flavour built against the default Python 3
  * Five new language extractors: COBOL, VB.NET, R, Solidity,
    Erlang (R/Erlang need their extras, not packaged)
  * Go interface requirements resolve to the interface; Rust
    self.method() calls resolve across files
  * graph.json now deterministic across runs (PYTHONHASHSEED
    pin); same-relation edge collisions keep EXTRACTED
  * Intra-module Go imports_from edges repoint onto real file
    nodes; Cargo introspection finds subdir manifests

